SUMMARY:Orientation to Ontario (O2O)
DESCRIPTION:This full-day\, in-person workshop is designed to guide participants through their settlement journey in Ontario\, offering practical tools\, essential resources\, and meaningful community connections.\nWhat’s Included:\n\nFree refreshments and pizza lunch\nTTC/Presto ticket for transportation\nInformation leaflets on key settlement topics\nCertificate of completion (available upon request)\n\nWho Should Attend:\nThis session is ideal for Refugee claimants\, Convention/protected persons\, International students\, Work permit holders\, Permanent residents.\n\nRegister here
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/orientation-to-ontario-o2o-2026-11-17/
LOCATION:CultureLink\, 2340 Dundas St W\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6P\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Orientation-to-Ontario-Web-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
