SUMMARY:CultureLink Youth Hub Weekly Drop-In
DESCRIPTION:The best part of Thursday starts here! 🌟 \nKids ages 6–13 are invited to join us every Thursday from 3:30–5:30 PM for a fun\, welcoming drop-in where they can connect\, create\, play\, and grow! \n🎨 Arts & crafts\n🎲 Board games & foosball\n🤝 Make new friends\n🍎 Snacks provided \nYouth ages 14–18: Looking to earn high school volunteer hours? Volunteer with us to build leadership and teamwork skills while making a difference! \nEligibility This program is open to newcomer children and youth with Permanent Resident (PR) or Convention Refugee (CR) status.\n🎟️ PRESTO tickets are provided.\n🍎 Free snacks are provided each week. \n📝 Click Here to Register: LINK HERE
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/culturelink-youth-hub-weekly-drop-in/2026-11-19/
LOCATION:CultureLink Children & Youth Centre\, 3535 Dundas Street West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Youth
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/CultureLink-Youth-Hub-Web-Icon.png
END:VEVENT
