SUMMARY:All-in-One PA Day Camp
DESCRIPTION:For Newcomer Kids and Youth ( permanent Residents and Convention Refugees) \nFor Kids (ages 6-12)  \n\nFull- day program \nWellness info session \nArt\, Board games\, ping pong and foosball \nNintendo switch games \n\nFor Youth (ages 13-18)  \n\nVolunteering opportunities\,  \nHelp run group activities  \nEarn up to 8 volunteer hours (Documents will be provided the same day after volunteering) \n\nLunch and Snacks will be provided  \nTo register: please fill this form  \nFor more information: please contact Anton at agordiienko@culruelink.ca or call 437-245-1118  \n 
