SUMMARY:Resume First\, LinkedIn Next
DESCRIPTION:The Smart Strategy for job Seekers \nYour resume and LinkedIn profile are powerful tools in shaping your professional brand\, but they serve different purposes. While your resume is tailored for specific job applications\, your LinkedIn profile is your digital networking hub. Strategically aligning these tools can increase your visibility\, strengthen your brand\, and improve your job search success. We will also include tips for internationally educated professionals. \nJoin us to learn how to optimise both your resume and LinkedIn profile\, starting with your resume first\, to make a lasting impact on employers and recruiters. \n\nBuild a consistent brand\nOptimise for visibility\nShowcase your experience\n\nFacilitator: Lynne Williams\, M.Ed.\, Executive Director\, Great Careers Network. \nRegister now! \n  \nSponsored by the Ontario Association of Certified Engineering Technicians and Technologists (OACETT)
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/resume-first-linkedin-next/
LOCATION:Online
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Resume-first-banner.png
END:VEVENT
