SUMMARY:Winter Wellness!
DESCRIPTION:Stay cozy\, healthy\, and well-rested this winter! Join our online Winter Wellness session to learn simple ways to take care of your well-being during the colder months.  \nWhat You’ll Receive: \nEvery registered participant will receive:  \n\nA relaxing wellness session \nSimple tips for winter health\nA FREE Winter Wellness Pack! \n\nWhat’s Inside Your Winter Pack?  \n\nHand warmer \nStress ball \nTea or hot chocolate sachets \nNotebook and pen \nMindfulness cards\n\nHow to Participate  \nAttend the online wellness session and pick up your complimentary Winter Wellness Pack from the CultureLink Head Office.  \nWho Can Register?  \nThis program is open to Permanent Residents and Convention Refugees.  \nSpots are limited! Register now to reserve your place and enjoy a warmer\, healthier winter.  \nTo register: Please fill this form  \nFor more information: please contact Kristelle at 437-335-2279 or ktalia@culturelink.ca
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/winter-wellness/
LOCATION:
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Newcomer-Mental-Health-Support-CultureLink-Settlement-Services-in-Toronto-Canada.jpg
END:VEVENT
