SUMMARY:Find Your Next Job in Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Newcomer Youth Success: Employment Services  \nFree workshop for newcomers  \nWho Can Participate?    \nThis workshop is for newcomer youth:  Ages 15–30 with permanent residents or convention refugees status. \nDiscover job opportunities in a variety of industries:   \n\nHospitality  \nCustomer Service  \nManufacturing  \nAdministration \n\nWhat You’ll Learn    \n\nDiscover job postings and application links \nLearn how to match your skills to a job \nGet helpful resume writing tips  \nLearn how to prepare for job interviews\n\nBe Prepared and have your resume ready!  \nTo Register:  \nPlease fill this form  \nFor more information\, please contact Olean at 437-225-0568 or email her at oyatsura@culturelink.ca  \nYour Future Starts Here!  \nExplore opportunities\, build your confidence\, and take a step closer to your employment goals. 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/find-your-next-job-in-toronto/
LOCATION:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/find-your-next-job-in-toronto/
CATEGORIES:Youth
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Newcomer-Youth-Success-Web-Icon.png
END:VEVENT
